This gives the zone a valid starting point without creating a separate scoring or trading path. From this point, the zone is managed like any other zone. Its lifecycle state, interactions, scoring changes, and buy/sell trigger flags can therefore be persisted alongside automatically detected zones. The result is a single managed pipeline:
